<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian industrial output surges 5.8 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Slovenian industrial output surges 5.8 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of</p>
<p>Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     July   June    July 1995</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)	  +5.8   -6.4     -11.7</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)		  +6.2  -11.4	+1.3</p>
<p>    Index (base 1995)		  103.3   97.6	97.3</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-84-39</p>
</text>
